      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَتْقَآءُ</span></b> , applied to a woman, means <i>Having the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرْج</span> <i>dehiscent;</i> [or <i>wide; not constringed;</i>]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَرْجِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْفَتِقَةُ</span></b> ; (S, O, K;) <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَتْقَآءُ</span> [q. v.].
(S, O.)

